.\\nSTORY SECTION: The LORD descends on Sinai\\n\\nMOMENT (Exodus 19:18): Mount Sinai, the whole of it, smoked, because Yahweh descended on it in fire; and its smoke ascended like the smoke of a furnace, and the whole mountain quaked greatly.\\nPREVIOUS: Moses led the people out of the camp to meet God; and they stood at the lower part of the mountain.\\nNEXT: When the sound of the trumpet grew louder and louder, Moses spoke, and God answered him by a voice.\\n\\nCAST ON STAGE IN THIS SECTION (id: name):\\n- moses: Moses (hasForm: true)\\n- god: God / Yahweh, the Father and God of Israel (hasForm: false)\\n- mount_sinai: Mount Sinai (hasForm: true)\\n\\nSECTION LOOK GUIDE (a suggestion; keep what fits this moment):\\n{\\\"place\\\":\\\"The gravel plain below a smoking mountain\\\",\\\"timeOfDay\\\":\\\"Morning\\\",\\\"weather\\\":\\\"Thick cloud and smoke over the summit\\\",\\\"light\\\":\\\"Fire glowing through smoke\\\",\\\"clothing\\\":\\\"Wool cloaks and head coverings\\\"}\\n\\nA PREVIOUS PLAN FOR THIS MOMENT WAS REJECTED. Write a new plan that fixes every problem below and keeps what was correct:\\n- outside_instant: Moses is not at the mountain at this instant. (plan said: \\\"Moses at the front of the trembling crowd\\\")\"}],\"response_format\":{\"type\":\"json_schema\",\"json_schema\":{\"name\":\"scene_plan\",\"strict\":true,\"schema\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"focusQuote\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"A few words copied from MOMENT naming what this image shows.\"},\"instant\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"One sentence fixing the single instant to draw: who is where, doing what.\"},\"selectedCast\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"items\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"entryId\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"enum\":[\"moses\",\"god\",\"mount_sinai\"]},\"evidence\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"A few words from the text that put this entry in the scene.\"}},\"required\":[\"entryId\",\"evidence\"],\"additionalProperties\":false},\"description\":\"Every section cast entry visible in the image, once each: people, groups, places, objects and presences shown through effects. Empty when none is.\"},\"primarySubject\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"The main subject and its pose or placement at that instant. For a cast entry with hasForm false, describe only the smoke, cloud, fire, wind or light the text names, never the entry itself. One or two short phrases.\"},\"action\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"What happens at that one instant. For a cast entry with hasForm false, describe only the smoke, cloud, fire, wind or light the text names, never the entry itself. One or two short phrases.\"},\"setting\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"The physical place and surroundings, consistent with the text and era. One or two short phrases.\"},\"secondaryElements\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"Supporting people, props and effects with their placement. One or two short phrases.\"},\"mood\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"The emotional atmosphere of the moment. One or two short phrases.\"},\"timeOfDay\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"This moment's time of day, weather and situational light. One or two short phrases.\"},\"composition\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"Viewpoint, framing and placement of the subjects, independent of art style. One or two short phrases.\"}},\"required\":[\"focusQuote\",\"instant\",\"selectedCast\",\"primarySubject\",\"action\",\"setting\",\"secondaryElements\",\"mood\",\"timeOfDay\",\"composition\"],\"additionalProperties\":false}}},\"provider\":{\"require_parameters\":true,\"order\":[\"anthropic\"],\"allow_fallbacks\":false},\"reasoning\":{\"effort\":\"none\"},\"max_tokens\":2400,\"usage\":{\"include\":true}}",
